# Ling 3.2 Flash — excluded by Beam

- Source: Beam (opencode/beam-free)
- Date: 2026-11-10 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Status: **excluded — no verified public benchmarks for "Ling 3.2 Flash"**; no scores reported.

## Model card

- **Claimed name:** Ling 3.2 Flash (folder slug `ling-3.2-flash`, id `opencode/ling-3.2-flash`).
- **Finding:** Ant Group's native multimodal Ling-series MoE (560B total / 25B active, 1M context). Ant's official documentation describes capabilities qualitatively (complex visual understanding, multimodal long-horizon agent, 3D interaction, medical multimodal) but publishes no standardized benchmark scores (no SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, GPQA, HLE, MRCR, OSWorld, or Artificial Analysis row) for this exact ID.
- **Context window / modalities / pricing:** 1,000,000 total; text, image and video in, text out; $0.30/$0.90 per 1M (Ant Bailian; two-week free trial at launch, no standing free tier).

### Raw benchmarks found

- No verified public benchmark score found for Ling 3.2 Flash in any first-party or independent source: Ant docs list capabilities only; no Artificial Analysis / Epoch AI / Vals AI / BenchLM / SWE-bench / Terminal-Bench / OSWorld / GPQA / HLE row for this exact ID.

